== Feature

We should support `member` entities, with the flexibility to discriminate roles e.g. `maintainer` and `contributor`.
This will allow for identitying users by their signing key, supporting gates for updating refs, and more.
I'm inclined to say we should have a single entity type --- `member` --- with a `role` field.
We could alternatively have separate entity types for each role, but that seems to be unnecessary complexity.
Both library and CLI support should be included.
